      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese text of resolution WHA71.7 on digital health opens with the preamble recalling eHealth resolutions and recognizing the potential of digital technologies for the Sustainable Development Goals. It stresses that human interaction remains key and that digital solutions should complement services. It also highlights the importance of technology transfer and cooperation.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
